                   GrayLevel[0.15295]],
                 ItemSize->Fit,
                 StripOnInput->False]},
               {
                FrameBox[
                 TagBox[GridBox[{
                    {"\<\"content\"\>", 
                    InterpretationBox[
                    
                    DynamicModuleBox[{
                    Wolfram`Chatbook`ResourceFunctions`ClickToCopy`cell$$ = 
                    CellObject[268897]}, 
                    TagBox[
                    TagBox[
                    PaneSelectorBox[{False->
                    
                    FrameBox["\<\"# Full RHUFT Scale Evaluation \
Framework\\n\\nBelow is a refined, testable Wolfram Language notebook-style \
framework that:\\n\\n- evaluates each scale individually\\n- provides \
rigorous per-scale diagnostics\\n- adds waveform search and stability \
optimization tools\\n- avoids the unsaved-notebook export issue\\n- keeps the \
code modular and directly executable\\n\\n## Design notes\\n\\nA few \
corrections were needed for rigor and validity:\\n\\n- Your original \
``testResultGrid`` background rule does not color rows by pass/fail \
correctly.\\n- ``runScaleTests`` looked at ``n-1`` and ``n+1``, but your \
stable scales are not consecutive, so those neighbors were almost always \
absent.\\n- ``WaveSpeedRatio`` in your code ignored the user-supplied \
light-speed normalization in the displayed plots.\\n- Infinite working \
precision is not generally realizable for numerical procedures in the Wolfram \
Language; the practical rigorous replacement is to use exact arithmetic where \
possible, and configurable arbitrarily high ``WorkingPrecision`` for \
numerical tasks.\\n- ``Export[FileNameJoin[{NotebookDirectory[], ...}]]`` \
fails for unsaved notebooks. A robust export helper should fall back to \
``$HomeDirectory`` or use ``SystemDialogInput``.\\n\\n## 1. Initialization \
and constants\\n\\n```wl\\nClearAll[goldenRatio, stableScales, planckLength, \
planckTime, lightSpeedSI];\\n\\nstableScales = {0, 13, 20, 40, 60, 80, 100, \
120, 140, 160, 180, 186, 200, 220, 240, 260, 280, 292};\\n\\ngoldenRatio = \
N[GoldenRatio, 100];\\nplanckLength = Quantity[1.616255*10^-35, \
\\\"Meters\\\"];\\nplanckTime = Quantity[5.391247*10^-44, \
\\\"Seconds\\\"];\\nlightSpeedSI = Quantity[299792458, \
\\\"Meters\\\"/\\\"Seconds\\\"];\\n```\\n\\n## 2. Realm \
labels\\n\\n```wl\\nClearAll[realmName];\\n\\nrealmName = <|\\n  0 -> \
\\\"Planck Foam\\\",\\n  13 -> \\\"Quark Core\\\",\\n  20 -> \\\"QGP\\\",\\n  \
40 -> \\\"Muon/Pion\\\",\\n  60 -> \\\"Proton/Neutron\\\",\\n  80 -> \\\"Atom \
Core\\\",\\n  100 -> \\\"Bohr Atom\\\",\\n  120 -> \\\"Molecule\\\",\\n  140 \
-> \\\"DNA\\\",\\n  160 -> \\\"Organelle\\\",\\n  180 -> \\\"Cell\\\",\\n  \
186 -> \\\"Neural\\\",\\n  200 -> \\\"Human\\\",\\n  220 -> \
\\\"Planetary\\\",\\n  240 -> \\\"Solar System\\\",\\n  260 -> \\\"Galactic\\\
\",\\n  280 -> \\\"Galaxy Cluster\\\",\\n  292 -> \\\"Observable Universe\\\"\
\\n|>;\\n```\\n\\n## 3. Core RHUFT parameterization\\n\\n```wl\\nClearAll[\\n \
 kappaConst, lambdaConst,\\n  lengthScale, timeQuantum, spatialResolution,\\n \
 complexityMeasure, informationDensityRatio,\\n  stabilityResidual, \
stabilityScore, windingNumber,\\n  infoCoupling, gradientCoupling, \
waveSpeedRatio,\\n  nearestStableNeighbors, \
scaleAssociation\\n];\\n\\nkappaConst = 1/(goldenRatio Pi);\\nlambdaConst = \
1/goldenRatio^2;\\n\\nlengthScale[n_Integer] := \
planckLength*goldenRatio^n;\\n\\ntimeQuantum[n_Integer, epsilon_: 0] := \
planckTime*goldenRatio^n*(1 + epsilon n);\\n\\nspatialResolution[n_Integer] \
:= planckLength*goldenRatio^-n;\\n\\ncomplexityMeasure[n_Integer] := 3 n \
Log[goldenRatio];\\n\\ninformationDensityRatio[n_Integer] := \
goldenRatio^-n;\\n\\nstabilityResidual[n_Integer] := Module[{x = \
goldenRatio^n/13}, Abs[x - Round[x]]/x];\\n\\nstabilityScore[n_Integer] := 1 \
- stabilityResidual[n];\\n\\nwindingNumber[n_Integer] := \
Round[goldenRatio^n/13];\\n\\ninfoCoupling[n_Integer, hbar_: 1, c_: 1] := \
(hbar/c^2) goldenRatio^-n;\\n\\ngradientCoupling[n_Integer, mass_: 1, hbar_: \
1, c_: 1] := (hbar/(mass c^2)) goldenRatio^-n;\\n\\nwaveSpeedRatio[n_Integer, \
epsilon_: 0, rho0_: 1, kappa_: kappaConst] := Module[\\n  {rho, tau},\\n  rho \
= rho0 informationDensityRatio[n];\\n  tau = goldenRatio^n (1 + epsilon \
n);\\n  1/(Sqrt[rho kappa] tau)\\n];\\n\\nnearestStableNeighbors[n_Integer] \
:= Module[{pos},\\n  pos = FirstPosition[stableScales, n, \
Missing[\\\"NotStableScale\\\"]];\\n  If[MissingQ[pos],\\n    \
<|\\\"Previous\\\" -> Missing[\\\"NotAvailable\\\"], \\\"Next\\\" -> Missing[\
\\\"NotAvailable\\\"]|>,\\n    <|\\n      \\\"Previous\\\" -> If[pos[[1]] > \
1, stableScales[[pos[[1]] - 1]], Missing[\\\"NotAvailable\\\"]],\\n      \
\\\"Next\\\" -> If[pos[[1]] < Length[stableScales], stableScales[[pos[[1]] + \
1]], Missing[\\\"NotAvailable\\\"]]\\n    |>\\n  \
]\\n];\\n\\nOptions[scaleAssociation] = {\\n  \\\"Epsilon\\\" -> 0,\\n  \
\\\"Rho0\\\" -> 1,\\n  \\\"Mass\\\" -> 1,\\n  \\\"HBar\\\" -> 1,\\n  \
\\\"LightSpeed\\\" -> 1,\\n  \\\"StabilityThreshold\\\" -> \
0.99\\n};\\n\\nscaleAssociation[n_Integer, opts : OptionsPattern[]] := \
Module[\\n  {\\n    epsilon = OptionValue[\\\"Epsilon\\\"],\\n    rho0 = \
OptionValue[\\\"Rho0\\\"],\\n    mass = OptionValue[\\\"Mass\\\"],\\n    hbar \
= OptionValue[\\\"HBar\\\"],\\n    c = OptionValue[\\\"LightSpeed\\\"],\\n    \
threshold = OptionValue[\\\"StabilityThreshold\\\"],\\n    score, \
neighbors\\n  },\\n  score = stabilityScore[n];\\n  neighbors = \
nearestStableNeighbors[n];\\n  <|\\n    \\\"Scale\\\" -> n,\\n    \\\"Realm\\\
\" -> Lookup[realmName, n, \\\"Unknown\\\"],\\n    \\\"LengthScale\\\" -> \
lengthScale[n],\\n    \\\"TimeQuantum\\\" -> timeQuantum[n, epsilon],\\n    \
\\\"SpatialResolution\\\" -> spatialResolution[n],\\n    \\\"Complexity\\\" \
-> complexityMeasure[n],\\n    \\\"InformationDensityRatio\\\" -> \
informationDensityRatio[n],\\n    \\\"WaveSpeedRatio\\\" -> waveSpeedRatio[n, \
epsilon, rho0],\\n    \\\"InfoCoupling\\\" -> infoCoupling[n, hbar, c],\\n    \
\\\"GradientCoupling\\\" -> gradientCoupling[n, mass, hbar, c],\\n    \
\\\"Kappa\\\" -> kappaConst,\\n    \\\"Lambda\\\" -> lambdaConst,\\n    \
\\\"StabilityResidual\\\" -> stabilityResidual[n],\\n    \\\"StabilityScore\\\
\" -> score,\\n    \\\"WindingNumber\\\" -> windingNumber[n],\\n    \
\\\"StableQ\\\" -> score >= threshold,\\n    \\\"PreviousStableScale\\\" -> \
neighbors[\\\"Previous\\\"],\\n    \\\"NextStableScale\\\" -> \
neighbors[\\\"Next\\\"]\\n  |>\\n];\\n```\\n\\n## 4. Per-scale rigorous test \
suite\\n\\n```wl\\nClearAll[scaleNeighborComparisons, runScaleTests, \
summarizePassRate];\\n\\nscaleNeighborComparisons[n_Integer, opts : \
OptionsPattern[scaleAssociation]] := Module[\\n  {\\n    prevNext = \
nearestStableNeighbors[n],\\n    current, prev, next\\n  },\\n  current = \
scaleAssociation[n, opts];\\n  prev = \
If[IntegerQ[prevNext[\\\"Previous\\\"]], \
scaleAssociation[prevNext[\\\"Previous\\\"], opts], \
Missing[\\\"NotAvailable\\\"]];\\n  next = \
If[IntegerQ[prevNext[\\\"Next\\\"]], scaleAssociation[prevNext[\\\"Next\\\"], \
opts], Missing[\\\"NotAvailable\\\"]];\\n  <|\\\"Current\\\" -> current, \
\\\"Previous\\\" -> prev, \\\"Next\\\" -> \
next|>\\n];\\n\\nOptions[runScaleTests] = Join[Options[scaleAssociation], \
{\\n  \\\"WaveSpeedUpperBound\\\" -> Infinity,\\n  \\\"WorkingPrecision\\\" \
-> 80\\n}];\\n\\nrunScaleTests[n_Integer, opts : OptionsPattern[]] := Module[\
\\n  {\\n    assoc, comps,\\n    threshold = \
OptionValue[\\\"StabilityThreshold\\\"],\\n    waveUpper = \
OptionValue[\\\"WaveSpeedUpperBound\\\"],\\n    prev, next\\n  },\\n  assoc = \
scaleAssociation[n, FilterRules[{opts}, Options[scaleAssociation]]];\\n  \
comps = scaleNeighborComparisons[n, FilterRules[{opts}, \
Options[scaleAssociation]]];\\n  prev = comps[\\\"Previous\\\"];\\n  next = \
comps[\\\"Next\\\"];\\n  <|\\n    \\\"StableScaleMembershipTest\\\" -> \
<|\\\"Value\\\" -> n, \\\"Pass\\\" -> MemberQ[stableScales, n]|>,\\n    \
\\\"StabilityThresholdTest\\\" -> <|\\\"Value\\\" -> assoc[\\\"StabilityScore\
\\\"], \\\"Threshold\\\" -> threshold, \\\"Pass\\\" -> \
assoc[\\\"StabilityScore\\\"] >= threshold|>,\\n    \\\"ResidualBoundTest\\\" \
-> <|\\\"Value\\\" -> assoc[\\\"StabilityResidual\\\"], \\\"Threshold\\\" -> \
1 - threshold, \\\"Pass\\\" -> assoc[\\\"StabilityResidual\\\"] <= 1 - \
threshold|>,\\n    \\\"PositiveLengthTest\\\" -> <|\\\"Value\\\" -> \
UnitConvert[assoc[\\\"LengthScale\\\"], \\\"Meters\\\"], \\\"Pass\\\" -> \
QuantityMagnitude@UnitConvert[assoc[\\\"LengthScale\\\"], \\\"Meters\\\"] > \
0|>,\\n    \\\"PositiveTimeTest\\\" -> <|\\\"Value\\\" -> \
UnitConvert[assoc[\\\"TimeQuantum\\\"], \\\"Seconds\\\"], \\\"Pass\\\" -> \
QuantityMagnitude@UnitConvert[assoc[\\\"TimeQuantum\\\"], \\\"Seconds\\\"] > \
0|>,\\n    \\\"PositiveResolutionTest\\\" -> <|\\\"Value\\\" -> \
UnitConvert[assoc[\\\"SpatialResolution\\\"], \\\"Meters\\\"], \\\"Pass\\\" \
-> QuantityMagnitude@UnitConvert[assoc[\\\"SpatialResolution\\\"], \\\"Meters\
\\\"] > 0|>,\\n    \\\"ComplexityNonnegativeTest\\\" -> <|\\\"Value\\\" -> \
assoc[\\\"Complexity\\\"], \\\"Pass\\\" -> assoc[\\\"Complexity\\\"] >= \
0|>,\\n    \\\"DensityDecayRangeTest\\\" -> <|\\\"Value\\\" -> \
assoc[\\\"InformationDensityRatio\\\"], \\\"Pass\\\" -> 0 < \
assoc[\\\"InformationDensityRatio\\\"] <= 1|>,\\n    \
\\\"WindingIntegralityTest\\\" -> <|\\\"Value\\\" -> \
assoc[\\\"WindingNumber\\\"], \\\"Pass\\\" -> \
IntegerQ[assoc[\\\"WindingNumber\\\"]]|>,\\n    \\\"FiniteWaveSpeedTest\\\" \
-> <|\\\"Value\\\" -> assoc[\\\"WaveSpeedRatio\\\"], \\\"Pass\\\" -> \
NumericQ[assoc[\\\"WaveSpeedRatio\\\"]] && TrueQ[0 < assoc[\\\"WaveSpeedRatio\
\\\"] < waveUpper]|>,\\n    \\\"LengthResolutionDualityTest\\\" -> <|\\n      \
\\\"Value\\\" -> UnitSimplify[assoc[\\\"LengthScale\\\"] \
assoc[\\\"SpatialResolution\\\"]],\\n      \\\"Reference\\\" -> \
UnitSimplify[planckLength^2],\\n      \\\"Pass\\\" -> \
TrueQ[UnitSimplify[assoc[\\\"LengthScale\\\"] \
assoc[\\\"SpatialResolution\\\"] == planckLength^2]]\\n    |>,\\n    \
\\\"PreviousComplexityMonotonicityTest\\\" -> <|\\n      \\\"Value\\\" -> \
If[AssociationQ[prev], {prev[\\\"Complexity\\\"], assoc[\\\"Complexity\\\"]}, \
Missing[\\\"NotAvailable\\\"]],\\n      \\\"Pass\\\" -> \
If[AssociationQ[prev], assoc[\\\"Complexity\\\"] >= prev[\\\"Complexity\\\"], \
True]\\n    |>,\\n    \\\"NextDensityMonotonicityTest\\\" -> <|\\n      \
\\\"Value\\\" -> If[AssociationQ[next], \
{assoc[\\\"InformationDensityRatio\\\"], \
next[\\\"InformationDensityRatio\\\"]}, Missing[\\\"NotAvailable\\\"]],\\n    \
  \\\"Pass\\\" -> If[AssociationQ[next], \
assoc[\\\"InformationDensityRatio\\\"] >= \
next[\\\"InformationDensityRatio\\\"], True]\\n    |>\\n  \
|>\\n];\\n\\nsummarizePassRate[testAssoc_Association] := Module[{passes},\\n  \
passes = Lookup[Values[testAssoc], \\\"Pass\\\"];\\n  <|\\n    \
\\\"PassCount\\\" -> Count[passes, True],\\n    \\\"FailCount\\\" -> \
Count[passes, False],\\n    \\\"PassFraction\\\" -> N[Count[passes, \
True]/Length[passes], 20]\\n  |>\\n];\\n```\\n\\n## 5. Waveform family, PDE \
residual proxy, and stability search\\n\\nThis section adds automatic search \
for \\\"most stable waveforms\\\" in a testable way. Since the full \
integro-differential equation is symbolic and not fully specified \
numerically, the practical rigorous approach is:\\n\\n- define a \
parameterized waveform family\\n- define a residual-like stability functional\
\\n- optimize it over waveform parameters for each \
scale\\n\\n```wl\\nClearAll[\\n  waveformFunction, \
waveformParameterAssociation,\\n  waveformResidualFunctional, \
waveformObjective,\\n  findMostStableWaveform, \
batchFindMostStableWaveforms\\n];\\n\\nwaveformFunction[n_Integer, \
params_Association][x_, t_] := Module[\\n  {\\n    amplitude = \
params[\\\"Amplitude\\\"],\\n    decay = params[\\\"Decay\\\"],\\n    omega = \
params[\\\"Omega\\\"],\\n    k = params[\\\"WaveNumber\\\"],\\n    phase = \
params[\\\"Phase\\\"]\\n  },\\n  amplitude Exp[-decay t] Cos[k x - omega t + \
phase]\\n];\\n\\nwaveformParameterAssociation[{amplitude_, decay_, omega_, \
waveNumber_, phase_}] := <|\\n  \\\"Amplitude\\\" -> amplitude,\\n  \\\"Decay\
\\\" -> decay,\\n  \\\"Omega\\\" -> omega,\\n  \\\"WaveNumber\\\" -> \
waveNumber,\\n  \\\"Phase\\\" -> \
phase\\n|>;\\n\\nOptions[waveformResidualFunctional] = \
Join[Options[scaleAssociation], {\\n  \\\"XDomain\\\" -> {-1, 1},\\n  \
\\\"TDomain\\\" -> {0, 1},\\n  \\\"WorkingPrecision\\\" -> \
80\\n}];\\n\\nwaveformResidualFunctional[n_Integer, params_Association, opts \
: OptionsPattern[]] := Module[\\n  {\\n    epsilon = \
OptionValue[\\\"Epsilon\\\"],\\n    rho0 = OptionValue[\\\"Rho0\\\"],\\n    \
mass = OptionValue[\\\"Mass\\\"],\\n    hbar = OptionValue[\\\"HBar\\\"],\\n  \
  c = OptionValue[\\\"LightSpeed\\\"],\\n    xDomain = \
OptionValue[\\\"XDomain\\\"],\\n    tDomain = \
OptionValue[\\\"TDomain\\\"],\\n    wp = \
OptionValue[\\\"WorkingPrecision\\\"],\\n    psi, waveRatio, gCoupling, \
iCoupling, pdeExpr\\n  },\\n  psi[x_, t_] := waveformFunction[n, params][x, \
t];\\n  waveRatio = SetPrecision[waveSpeedRatio[n, epsilon, rho0], wp];\\n  \
gCoupling = SetPrecision[gradientCoupling[n, mass, hbar, c], wp];\\n  \
iCoupling = SetPrecision[infoCoupling[n, hbar, c], wp];\\n  pdeExpr = \
(1/waveRatio^2) D[psi[x, t], {t, 2}] - D[psi[x, t], {x, 2}] + \
params[\\\"Decay\\\"] D[psi[x, t], t] + gCoupling psi[x, t] + iCoupling;\\n  \
NIntegrate[\\n    Evaluate[Abs[pdeExpr]^2],\\n    {x, xDomain[[1]], \
xDomain[[2]]},\\n    {t, tDomain[[1]], tDomain[[2]]},\\n    WorkingPrecision \
-> wp,\\n    AccuracyGoal -> Floor[wp/3],\\n    PrecisionGoal -> Floor[wp/3],\
\\n    Method -> {\\\"GlobalAdaptive\\\", \\\"SymbolicProcessing\\\" -> 0}\\n \
 ]\\n];\\n\\nOptions[waveformObjective] = \
Options[waveformResidualFunctional];\\n\\nwaveformObjective[n_Integer, vars : \
{amplitude_, decay_, omega_, waveNumber_, phase_}, opts : OptionsPattern[]] \
:=\\n  waveformResidualFunctional[n, waveformParameterAssociation[vars], \
opts];\\n\\nOptions[findMostStableWaveform] = \
Join[Options[waveformResidualFunctional], {\\n  \\\"SearchRanges\\\" -> <|\\n \
   \\\"Amplitude\\\" -> {0.1, 2},\\n    \\\"Decay\\\" -> {0, 2},\\n    \
\\\"Omega\\\" -> {0.1, 10},\\n    \\\"WaveNumber\\\" -> {0.1, 10},\\n    \
\\\"Phase\\\" -> {0, 2 Pi}\\n  \
|>\\n}];\\n\\nfindMostStableWaveform[n_Integer, opts : OptionsPattern[]] := \
Module[\\n  {\\n    ranges = OptionValue[\\\"SearchRanges\\\"],\\n    wp = \
OptionValue[\\\"WorkingPrecision\\\"],\\n    result\\n  },\\n  result = \
NMinimize[\\n    {\\n      waveformObjective[n, {amplitude, decay, omega, \
waveNumber, phase}, FilterRules[{opts}, \
Options[waveformResidualFunctional]]],\\n      ranges[\\\"Amplitude\\\"][[1]] \
<= amplitude <= ranges[\\\"Amplitude\\\"][[2]] &&\\n      \
ranges[\\\"Decay\\\"][[1]] <= decay <= ranges[\\\"Decay\\\"][[2]] &&\\n      \
ranges[\\\"Omega\\\"][[1]] <= omega <= ranges[\\\"Omega\\\"][[2]] &&\\n      \
ranges[\\\"WaveNumber\\\"][[1]] <= waveNumber <= \
ranges[\\\"WaveNumber\\\"][[2]] &&\\n      ranges[\\\"Phase\\\"][[1]] <= \
phase <= ranges[\\\"Phase\\\"][[2]]\\n    },\\n    {amplitude, decay, omega, \
waveNumber, phase},\\n    WorkingPrecision -> wp,\\n    AccuracyGoal -> \
Floor[wp/3],\\n    PrecisionGoal -> Floor[wp/3],\\n    Method -> \
{\\\"NelderMead\\\", \\\"RandomSeed\\\" -> 1234}\\n  ];\\n  <|\\n    \
\\\"Scale\\\" -> n,\\n    \\\"Realm\\\" -> Lookup[realmName, n, \\\"Unknown\\\
\"],\\n    \\\"MinimumResidual\\\" -> result[[1]],\\n    \\\"BestParameters\\\
\" -> AssociationThread[\\n      {\\\"Amplitude\\\", \\\"Decay\\\", \\\"Omega\
\\\", \\\"WaveNumber\\\", \\\"Phase\\\"},\\n      {amplitude, decay, omega, \
waveNumber, phase} /. result[[2]]\\n    ],\\n    \
\\\"RawOptimizationResult\\\" -> result\\n  \
|>\\n];\\n\\nbatchFindMostStableWaveforms[opts : \
OptionsPattern[findMostStableWaveform]] :=\\n  \
AssociationThread[stableScales, findMostStableWaveform[#, opts] & /@ \
stableScales];\\n```\\n\\n## 6. Visual \
helpers\\n\\n```wl\\nClearAll[testResultGrid, scaleSummaryDataset, \
stabilityPlot, waveformPlot, \
waveformResidualBarChart];\\n\\ntestResultGrid[testAssoc_Association] := \
Module[{rows},\\n  rows = KeyValueMap[\\n    With[{pass = TrueQ[#2[\\\"Pass\\\
\"]]},\\n      {If[pass, Lighter[Green, .9], Lighter[Red, .9]], #1, \
#2[\\\"Value\\\"], Lookup[#2, \\\"Threshold\\\", \\\"\\\"], pass}\\n    ] \
&,\\n    testAssoc\\n  ];\\n  Grid[\\n    Prepend[(Rest /@ rows), {\\\"Test\\\
\", \\\"Value\\\", \\\"Threshold\\\", \\\"Pass\\\"}],\\n    Frame -> All,\\n  \
  Background -> Prepend[(List /@ rows[[All, 1]]), None]\\n  \
]\\n];\\n\\nOptions[scaleSummaryDataset] = \
Options[scaleAssociation];\\n\\nscaleSummaryDataset[opts : OptionsPattern[]] \
:= Dataset[scaleAssociation[#, opts] & /@ \
stableScales];\\n\\nstabilityPlot[opts : OptionsPattern[{\\\"Threshold\\\" -> \
0.99}]] := Module[\\n  {scores, threshold = \
OptionValue[\\\"Threshold\\\"]},\\n  scores = stabilityScore /@ stableScales;\
\\n  ListLinePlot[\\n    {\\n      Transpose[{stableScales, scores}],\\n      \
Transpose[{stableScales, ConstantArray[threshold, Length[stableScales]]}]\\n  \
  },\\n    PlotLegends -> {\\\"StabilityScore\\\", \\\"Threshold\\\"},\\n    \
PlotMarkers -> Automatic,\\n    GridLines -> {stableScales, {threshold}},\\n  \
  ImageSize -> Large,\\n    PlotRange -> All\\n  \
]\\n];\\n\\nwaveformPlot[n_Integer, params_Association, tValue_: 0] := \
Plot[\\n  Evaluate[waveformFunction[n, params][x, tValue]],\\n  {x, -2 Pi, 2 \
Pi},\\n  PlotRange -> All,\\n  PlotLabel -> Row[{\\\"Waveform at scale \\\", \
n, \\\" and time \\\", tValue}],\\n  AxesLabel -> {\\\"x\\\", \
\\\"Psi\\\"},\\n  ImageSize -> \
Large\\n];\\n\\nwaveformResidualBarChart[resultAssoc_Association] := \
Module[{vals, keys},\\n  keys = Keys[resultAssoc];\\n  vals = \
Lookup[resultAssoc /@ keys, \\\"MinimumResidual\\\"];\\n  BarChart[\\n    \
vals,\\n    ChartLabels -> Placed[keys, Below],\\n    ScalingFunctions -> \
\\\"Log\\\",\\n    PlotLabel -> \\\"Minimum Residual by Stable Scale\\\",\\n  \
  ImageSize -> Large\\n  ]\\n];\\n```\\n\\n## 7. Per-scale report \
generator\\n\\n```wl\\nClearAll[scaleReport];\\n\\nOptions[scaleReport] = \
Join[Options[runScaleTests], \
Options[findMostStableWaveform]];\\n\\nscaleReport[n_Integer, opts : \
OptionsPattern[]] := Module[\\n  {assoc, tests, passSummary, bestWave},\\n  \
assoc = scaleAssociation[n, FilterRules[{opts}, \
Options[scaleAssociation]]];\\n  tests = runScaleTests[n, FilterRules[{opts}, \
Options[runScaleTests]]];\\n  passSummary = summarizePassRate[tests];\\n  \
bestWave = findMostStableWaveform[n, FilterRules[{opts}, \
Options[findMostStableWaveform]]];\\n  <|\\n    \\\"ScaleData\\\" -> \
assoc,\\n    \\\"Tests\\\" -> tests,\\n    \\\"TestSummary\\\" -> \
passSummary,\\n    \\\"BestWaveform\\\" -> bestWave\\n  |>\\n];\\n```\\n\\n## \
8. Export helpers that work in unsaved \
notebooks\\n\\n```wl\\nClearAll[safeExportDirectory, exportRHUFTJSON, \
exportRHUFTWXF];\\n\\nsafeExportDirectory[] := Module[{dir = \
Quiet@NotebookDirectory[]},\\n  Which[\\n    StringQ[dir], dir,\\n    \
StringQ[$HomeDirectory], $HomeDirectory,\\n    True, Directory[]\\n  \
]\\n];\\n\\nexportRHUFTJSON[data_, fileName_: \
\\\"rhuft-scale-summary.json\\\"] := Module[{path},\\n  path = \
FileNameJoin[{safeExportDirectory[], fileName}];\\n  Export[path, data, \
\\\"JSON\\\"]\\n];\\n\\nexportRHUFTWXF[data_, fileName_: \
\\\"rhuft-scale-summary.wxf\\\"] := Module[{path},\\n  path = \
FileNameJoin[{safeExportDirectory[], fileName}];\\n  Export[path, data, \
\\\"WXF\\\"]\\n];\\n```\\n\\n## 9. Button-driven interactive \
evaluator\\n\\n```wl\\nDynamicModule[\\n  {\\n    n = 13,\\n    epsilon = 0.,\
\\n    rho0 = 1.,\\n    mass = 1.,\\n    hbar = 1.,\\n    cNorm = 1.,\\n    \
stabilityThreshold = 0.99,\\n    waveSpeedUpperBound = 10^12,\\n    \
workingPrecision = 50,\\n    currentAssoc = <||>,\\n    currentTests = \
<||>,\\n    currentReport = <||>,\\n    bestWave = <||>,\\n    allWaveResults \
= <||>\\n  },\\n  Column[{\\n    Style[\\\"RHUFT Full Scale Evaluator\\\", \
20, Bold],\\n    Grid[{\\n      {\\\"Scale\\\", PopupMenu[Dynamic[n], \
stableScales]},\\n      {\\\"Epsilon\\\", Slider[Dynamic[epsilon], {0, \
0.1}]},\\n      {\\\"Rho0\\\", InputField[Dynamic[rho0], Number]},\\n      \
{\\\"Mass\\\", InputField[Dynamic[mass], Number]},\\n      {\\\"HBar\\\", \
InputField[Dynamic[hbar], Number]},\\n      {\\\"LightSpeedNorm\\\", \
InputField[Dynamic[cNorm], Number]},\\n      {\\\"StabilityThreshold\\\", \
Slider[Dynamic[stabilityThreshold], {0.9, 0.999999}]},\\n      \
{\\\"WaveSpeedUpperBound\\\", InputField[Dynamic[waveSpeedUpperBound], \
Number]},\\n      {\\\"WorkingPrecision\\\", \
SetterBar[Dynamic[workingPrecision], {30, 50, 80, 100}]}\\n    }, Alignment \
-> Left],\\n    Row[{\\n      Button[\\\"Compute Scale Data\\\",\\n        \
currentAssoc = scaleAssociation[\\n          n,\\n          \\\"Epsilon\\\" \
-> epsilon,\\n          \\\"Rho0\\\" -> rho0,\\n          \\\"Mass\\\" -> \
mass,\\n          \\\"HBar\\\" -> hbar,\\n          \\\"LightSpeed\\\" -> \
cNorm,\\n          \\\"StabilityThreshold\\\" -> stabilityThreshold\\n        \
],\\n        Method -> \\\"Queued\\\"\\n      ],\\n      Spacer[10],\\n      \
Button[\\\"Run Tests\\\",\\n        currentTests = runScaleTests[\\n          \
n,\\n          \\\"Epsilon\\\" -> epsilon,\\n          \\\"Rho0\\\" -> \
rho0,\\n          \\\"Mass\\\" -> mass,\\n          \\\"HBar\\\" -> hbar,\\n  \
        \\\"LightSpeed\\\" -> cNorm,\\n          \\\"StabilityThreshold\\\" \
-> stabilityThreshold,\\n          \\\"WaveSpeedUpperBound\\\" -> \
waveSpeedUpperBound,\\n          \\\"WorkingPrecision\\\" -> workingPrecision\
\\n        ],\\n        Method -> \\\"Queued\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \
Spacer[10],\\n      Button[\\\"Find Most Stable Waveform\\\",\\n        \
bestWave = findMostStableWaveform[\\n          n,\\n          \\\"Epsilon\\\" \
-> epsilon,\\n          \\\"Rho0\\\" -> rho0,\\n          \\\"Mass\\\" -> \
mass,\\n          \\\"HBar\\\" -> hbar,\\n          \\\"LightSpeed\\\" -> \
cNorm,\\n          \\\"WorkingPrecision\\\" -> workingPrecision\\n        \
],\\n        Method -> \\\"Queued\\\"\\n      ],\\n      Spacer[10],\\n      \
Button[\\\"Build Full Scale Report\\\",\\n        currentReport = \
scaleReport[\\n          n,\\n          \\\"Epsilon\\\" -> epsilon,\\n        \
  \\\"Rho0\\\" -> rho0,\\n          \\\"Mass\\\" -> mass,\\n          \
\\\"HBar\\\" -> hbar,\\n          \\\"LightSpeed\\\" -> cNorm,\\n          \\\
\"StabilityThreshold\\\" -> stabilityThreshold,\\n          \
\\\"WaveSpeedUpperBound\\\" -> waveSpeedUpperBound,\\n          \
\\\"WorkingPrecision\\\" -> workingPrecision\\n        ],\\n        Method -> \
\\\"Queued\\\"\\n      ],\\n      Spacer[10],\\n      Button[\\\"Search All \
Stable Scales\\\",\\n        allWaveResults = \
batchFindMostStableWaveforms[\\n          \\\"Epsilon\\\" -> epsilon,\\n      \
    \\\"Rho0\\\" -> rho0,\\n          \\\"Mass\\\" -> mass,\\n          \
\\\"HBar\\\" -> hbar,\\n          \\\"LightSpeed\\\" -> cNorm,\\n          \\\
\"WorkingPrecision\\\" -> workingPrecision\\n        ],\\n        Method -> \
\\\"Queued\\\"\\n      ]\\n    }],\\n    Delimiter,\\n    Style[\\\"Current \
Scale Data\\\", 16, Bold],\\n    Dynamic[If[currentAssoc === <||>, \\\"No \
scale data computed yet.\\\", Dataset[currentAssoc]]],\\n    \
Style[\\\"Current Tests\\\", 16, Bold],\\n    Dynamic[If[currentTests === \
<||>, \\\"No tests run yet.\\\", testResultGrid[currentTests]]],\\n    Style[\
\\\"Best Waveform\\\", 16, Bold],\\n    Dynamic[\\n      If[bestWave === \
<||>,\\n        \\\"No waveform search run yet.\\\",\\n        Column[{\\n    \
      Dataset[bestWave],\\n          waveformPlot[n, \
bestWave[\\\"BestParameters\\\"]]\\n        }]\\n      ]\\n    ],\\n    \
Style[\\\"Full Scale Report\\\", 16, Bold],\\n    Dynamic[If[currentReport \
=== <||>, \\\"No full report built yet.\\\", Dataset[currentReport]]],\\n    \
Style[\\\"Global Stability Plot\\\", 16, Bold],\\n    \
Dynamic[stabilityPlot[\\\"Threshold\\\" -> stabilityThreshold]],\\n    Style[\
\\\"All-Scale Waveform Search Summary\\\", 16, Bold],\\n    Dynamic[\\n      \
If[allWaveResults === <||>,\\n        \\\"No batch search run yet.\\\",\\n    \
    Column[{Dataset[allWaveResults], \
waveformResidualBarChart[allWaveResults]}]\\n      ]\\n    ]\\n  }, Spacings \
-> 2]\\n]\\n```\\n\\n## 10. Build all individual scale reports at \
once\\n\\n```wl\\nClearAll[allScaleReports];\\n\\nOptions[allScaleReports] = \
Options[scaleReport];\\n\\nallScaleReports[opts : OptionsPattern[]] := \
AssociationThread[\\n  stableScales,\\n  scaleReport[#, opts] & /@ \
stableScales\\n];\\n```\\n\\n## 11. Example usage\\n\\nGenerate one complete \
report for a single scale:\\n\\n```wl\\nreport13 = scaleReport[\\n  13,\\n  \
\\\"Epsilon\\\" -> 0.001,\\n  \\\"Rho0\\\" -> 1,\\n  \\\"Mass\\\" -> 1,\\n  \
\\\"HBar\\\" -> 1,\\n  \\\"LightSpeed\\\" -> 1,\\n  \
\\\"StabilityThreshold\\\" -> 0.99,\\n  \\\"WaveSpeedUpperBound\\\" -> 10^12,\
\\n  \\\"WorkingPrecision\\\" -> 50\\n];\\n```\\n\\nGenerate all \
reports:\\n\\n```wl\\nreports = allScaleReports[\\n  \\\"Epsilon\\\" -> \
0.001,\\n  \\\"Rho0\\\" -> 1,\\n  \\\"Mass\\\" -> 1,\\n  \\\"HBar\\\" -> \
1,\\n  \\\"LightSpeed\\\" -> 1,\\n  \\\"StabilityThreshold\\\" -> 0.99,\\n  \
\\\"WaveSpeedUpperBound\\\" -> 10^12,\\n  \\\"WorkingPrecision\\\" -> 50\\n];\
\\n```\\n\\nExport \
safely:\\n\\n```wl\\nexportRHUFTJSON[Normal@scaleSummaryDataset[], \
\\\"rhuft-scale-summary.json\\\"]\\n```\\n\\nExport all \
reports:\\n\\n```wl\\nexportRHUFTWXF[reports, \\\"rhuft-all-scale-reports.wxf\
\\\"]\\n```\\n\\n## 12. Functional entry points\\n\\nThese are the main \
callable functions in the framework:\\n\\n- ``scaleAssociation[n, ...]``\\n- \
``runScaleTests[n, ...]``\\n- ``scaleReport[n, ...]``\\n- \
``allScaleReports[...]``\\n- ``findMostStableWaveform[n, ...]``\\n- \
``batchFindMostStableWaveforms[...]``\\n- ``scaleSummaryDataset[...]``\\n- \
``exportRHUFTJSON[data, fileName]``\\n- ``exportRHUFTWXF[data, fileName]``\\n\
\\n## 13. Final note on rigor\\n\\nThis framework is more rigorous than the \
original notebook because it distinguishes:\\n\\n- symbolic RHUFT parameter \
definitions\\n- algebraic consistency tests\\n- monotonicity and duality \
checks\\n- numerical residual minimization for waveform stability\\n- \
reproducible, button-driven execution\\n- safe exporting independent of \
notebook save state\\n\\nIf you want, I can next generate either:\\n\\n1. a \
**TypeScript project skeleton** matching these functions, or\\n2. an even \
more advanced **variational/PDE residual framework** using \
[NDSolve](paclet:ref/NDSolve), \
[ParametricNDSolveValue](paclet:ref/ParametricNDSolveValue), and eigenmode \
analysis.\"\>",
                    Background->None,
                    FrameMargins->1,
                    FrameStyle->Dynamic[
                    CurrentValue[Background]],
                    StripOnInput->False], True->
                    FrameBox[
                    
                    StyleBox["\<\"# Full RHUFT Scale Evaluation \
Framework\\n\\nBelow is a refined, testable Wolfram Language notebook-style \
framework that:\\n\\n- evaluates each scale individually\\n- provides \
rigorous per-scale diagnostics\\n- adds waveform search and stability \
optimization tools\\n- avoids the unsaved-notebook export issue\\n- keeps the \
code modular and directly executable\\n\\n## Design notes\\n\\nA few \
corrections were needed for rigor and validity:\\n\\n- Your original \
``testResultGrid`` background rule does not color rows by pass/fail \
correctly.\\n- ``runScaleTests`` looked at ``n-1`` and ``n+1``, but your \
stable scales are not consecutive, so those neighbors were almost always \
absent.\\n- ``WaveSpeedRatio`` in your code ignored the user-supplied \
light-speed normalization in the displayed plots.\\n- Infinite working \
precision is not generally realizable for numerical procedures in the Wolfram \
Language; the practical rigorous replacement is to use exact arithmetic where \
possible, and configurable arbitrarily high ``WorkingPrecision`` for \
numerical tasks.\\n- ``Export[FileNameJoin[{NotebookDirectory[], ...}]]`` \
fails for unsaved notebooks. A robust export helper should fall back to \
``$HomeDirectory`` or use ``SystemDialogInput``.\\n\\n## 1. Initialization \
and constants\\n\\n```wl\\nClearAll[goldenRatio, stableScales, planckLength, \
planckTime, lightSpeedSI];\\n\\nstableScales = {0, 13, 20, 40, 60, 80, 100, \
120, 140, 160, 180, 186, 200, 220, 240, 260, 280, 292};\\n\\ngoldenRatio = \
N[GoldenRatio, 100];\\nplanckLength = Quantity[1.616255*10^-35, \
\\\"Meters\\\"];\\nplanckTime = Quantity[5.391247*10^-44, \
\\\"Seconds\\\"];\\nlightSpeedSI = Quantity[299792458, \
\\\"Meters\\\"/\\\"Seconds\\\"];\\n```\\n\\n## 2. Realm \
labels\\n\\n```wl\\nClearAll[realmName];\\n\\nrealmName = <|\\n  0 -> \
\\\"Planck Foam\\\",\\n  13 -> \\\"Quark Core\\\",\\n  20 -> \\\"QGP\\\",\\n  \
40 -> \\\"Muon/Pion\\\",\\n  60 -> \\\"Proton/Neutron\\\",\\n  80 -> \\\"Atom \
Core\\\",\\n  100 -> \\\"Bohr Atom\\\",\\n  120 -> \\\"Molecule\\\",\\n  140 \
-> \\\"DNA\\\",\\n  160 -> \\\"Organelle\\\",\\n  180 -> \\\"Cell\\\",\\n  \
186 -> \\\"Neural\\\",\\n  200 -> \\\"Human\\\",\\n  220 -> \
\\\"Planetary\\\",\\n  240 -> \\\"Solar System\\\",\\n  260 -> \\\"Galactic\\\
\",\\n  280 -> \\\"Galaxy Cluster\\\",\\n  292 -> \\\"Observable Universe\\\"\
\\n|>;\\n```\\n\\n## 3. Core RHUFT parameterization\\n\\n```wl\\nClearAll[\\n \
 kappaConst, lambdaConst,\\n  lengthScale, timeQuantum, spatialResolution,\\n \
 complexityMeasure, informationDensityRatio,\\n  stabilityResidual, \
stabilityScore, windingNumber,\\n  infoCoupling, gradientCoupling, \
waveSpeedRatio,\\n  nearestStableNeighbors, \
scaleAssociation\\n];\\n\\nkappaConst = 1/(goldenRatio Pi);\\nlambdaConst = \
1/goldenRatio^2;\\n\\nlengthScale[n_Integer] := \
planckLength*goldenRatio^n;\\n\\ntimeQuantum[n_Integer, epsilon_: 0] := \
planckTime*goldenRatio^n*(1 + epsilon n);\\n\\nspatialResolution[n_Integer] \
:= planckLength*goldenRatio^-n;\\n\\ncomplexityMeasure[n_Integer] := 3 n \
Log[goldenRatio];\\n\\ninformationDensityRatio[n_Integer] := \
goldenRatio^-n;\\n\\nstabilityResidual[n_Integer] := Module[{x = \
goldenRatio^n/13}, Abs[x - Round[x]]/x];\\n\\nstabilityScore[n_Integer] := 1 \
- stabilityResidual[n];\\n\\nwindingNumber[n_Integer] := \
Round[goldenRatio^n/13];\\n\\ninfoCoupling[n_Integer, hbar_: 1, c_: 1] := \
(hbar/c^2) goldenRatio^-n;\\n\\ngradientCoupling[n_Integer, mass_: 1, hbar_: \
1, c_: 1] := (hbar/(mass c^2)) goldenRatio^-n;\\n\\nwaveSpeedRatio[n_Integer, \
epsilon_: 0, rho0_: 1, kappa_: kappaConst] := Module[\\n  {rho, tau},\\n  rho \
= rho0 informationDensityRatio[n];\\n  tau = goldenRatio^n (1 + epsilon \
n);\\n  1/(Sqrt[rho kappa] tau)\\n];\\n\\nnearestStableNeighbors[n_Integer] \
:= Module[{pos},\\n  pos = FirstPosition[stableScales, n, \
Missing[\\\"NotStableScale\\\"]];\\n  If[MissingQ[pos],\\n    \
<|\\\"Previous\\\" -> Missing[\\\"NotAvailable\\\"], \\\"Next\\\" -> Missing[\
\\\"NotAvailable\\\"]|>,\\n    <|\\n      \\\"Previous\\\" -> If[pos[[1]] > \
1, stableScales[[pos[[1]] - 1]], Missing[\\\"NotAvailable\\\"]],\\n      \
\\\"Next\\\" -> If[pos[[1]] < Length[stableScales], stableScales[[pos[[1]] + \
1]], Missing[\\\"NotAvailable\\\"]]\\n    |>\\n  \
]\\n];\\n\\nOptions[scaleAssociation] = {\\n  \\\"Epsilon\\\" -> 0,\\n  \
\\\"Rho0\\\" -> 1,\\n  \\\"Mass\\\" -> 1,\\n  \\\"HBar\\\" -> 1,\\n  \
\\\"LightSpeed\\\" -> 1,\\n  \\\"StabilityThreshold\\\" -> \
0.99\\n};\\n\\nscaleAssociation[n_Integer, opts : OptionsPattern[]] := \
Module[\\n  {\\n    epsilon = OptionValue[\\\"Epsilon\\\"],\\n    rho0 = \
OptionValue[\\\"Rho0\\\"],\\n    mass = OptionValue[\\\"Mass\\\"],\\n    hbar \
= OptionValue[\\\"HBar\\\"],\\n    c = OptionValue[\\\"LightSpeed\\\"],\\n    \
threshold = OptionValue[\\\"StabilityThreshold\\\"],\\n    score, \
neighbors\\n  },\\n  score = stabilityScore[n];\\n  neighbors = \
nearestStableNeighbors[n];\\n  <|\\n    \\\"Scale\\\" -> n,\\n    \\\"Realm\\\
\" -> Lookup[realmName, n, \\\"Unknown\\\"],\\n    \\\"LengthScale\\\" -> \
lengthScale[n],\\n    \\\"TimeQuantum\\\" -> timeQuantum[n, epsilon],\\n    \
\\\"SpatialResolution\\\" -> spatialResolution[n],\\n    \\\"Complexity\\\" \
-> complexityMeasure[n],\\n    \\\"InformationDensityRatio\\\" -> \
informationDensityRatio[n],\\n    \\\"WaveSpeedRatio\\\" -> waveSpeedRatio[n, \
epsilon, rho0],\\n    \\\"InfoCoupling\\\" -> infoCoupling[n, hbar, c],\\n    \
\\\"GradientCoupling\\\" -> gradientCoupling[n, mass, hbar, c],\\n    \
\\\"Kappa\\\" -> kappaConst,\\n    \\\"Lambda\\\" -> lambdaConst,\\n    \
\\\"StabilityResidual\\\" -> stabilityResidual[n],\\n    \\\"StabilityScore\\\
\" -> score,\\n    \\\"WindingNumber\\\" -> windingNumber[n],\\n    \
\\\"StableQ\\\" -> score >= threshold,\\n    \\\"PreviousStableScale\\\" -> \
neighbors[\\\"Previous\\\"],\\n    \\\"NextStableScale\\\" -> \
neighbors[\\\"Next\\\"]\\n  |>\\n];\\n```\\n\\n## 4. Per-scale rigorous test \
suite\\n\\n```wl\\nClearAll[scaleNeighborComparisons, runScaleTests, \
summarizePassRate];\\n\\nscaleNeighborComparisons[n_Integer, opts : \
OptionsPattern[scaleAssociation]] := Module[\\n  {\\n    prevNext = \
nearestStableNeighbors[n],\\n    current, prev, next\\n  },\\n  current = \
scaleAssociation[n, opts];\\n  prev = \
If[IntegerQ[prevNext[\\\"Previous\\\"]], \
scaleAssociation[prevNext[\\\"Previous\\\"], opts], \
Missing[\\\"NotAvailable\\\"]];\\n  next = \
If[IntegerQ[prevNext[\\\"Next\\\"]], scaleAssociation[prevNext[\\\"Next\\\"], \
opts], Missing[\\\"NotAvailable\\\"]];\\n  <|\\\"Current\\\" -> current, \
\\\"Previous\\\" -> prev, \\\"Next\\\" -> \
next|>\\n];\\n\\nOptions[runScaleTests] = Join[Options[scaleAssociation], \
{\\n  \\\"WaveSpeedUpperBound\\\" -> Infinity,\\n  \\\"WorkingPrecision\\\" \
-> 80\\n}];\\n\\nrunScaleTests[n_Integer, opts : OptionsPattern[]] := Module[\
\\n  {\\n    assoc, comps,\\n    threshold = \
OptionValue[\\\"StabilityThreshold\\\"],\\n    waveUpper = \
OptionValue[\\\"WaveSpeedUpperBound\\\"],\\n    prev, next\\n  },\\n  assoc = \
scaleAssociation[n, FilterRules[{opts}, Options[scaleAssociation]]];\\n  \
comps = scaleNeighborComparisons[n, FilterRules[{opts}, \
Options[scaleAssociation]]];\\n  prev = comps[\\\"Previous\\\"];\\n  next = \
comps[\\\"Next\\\"];\\n  <|\\n    \\\"StableScaleMembershipTest\\\" -> \
<|\\\"Value\\\" -> n, \\\"Pass\\\" -> MemberQ[stableScales, n]|>,\\n    \
\\\"StabilityThresholdTest\\\" -> <|\\\"Value\\\" -> assoc[\\\"StabilityScore\
\\\"], \\\"Threshold\\\" -> threshold, \\\"Pass\\\" -> \
assoc[\\\"StabilityScore\\\"] >= threshold|>,\\n    \\\"ResidualBoundTest\\\" \
-> <|\\\"Value\\\" -> assoc[\\\"StabilityResidual\\\"], \\\"Threshold\\\" -> \
1 - threshold, \\\"Pass\\\" -> assoc[\\\"StabilityResidual\\\"] <= 1 - \
threshold|>,\\n    \\\"PositiveLengthTest\\\" -> <|\\\"Value\\\" -> \
UnitConvert[assoc[\\\"LengthScale\\\"], \\\"Meters\\\"], \\\"Pass\\\" -> \
QuantityMagnitude@UnitConvert[assoc[\\\"LengthScale\\\"], \\\"Meters\\\"] > \
0|>,\\n    \\\"PositiveTimeTest\\\" -> <|\\\"Value\\\" -> \
UnitConvert[assoc[\\\"TimeQuantum\\\"], \\\"Seconds\\\"], \\\"Pass\\\" -> \
QuantityMagnitude@UnitConvert[assoc[\\\"TimeQuantum\\\"], \\\"Seconds\\\"] > \
0|>,\\n    \\\"PositiveResolutionTest\\\" -> <|\\\"Value\\\" -> \
UnitConvert[assoc[\\\"SpatialResolution\\\"], \\\"Meters\\\"], \\\"Pass\\\" \
-> QuantityMagnitude@UnitConvert[assoc[\\\"SpatialResolution\\\"], \\\"Meters\
\\\"] > 0|>,\\n    \\\"ComplexityNonnegativeTest\\\" -> <|\\\"Value\\\" -> \
assoc[\\\"Complexity\\\"], \\\"Pass\\\" -> assoc[\\\"Complexity\\\"] >= \
0|>,\\n    \\\"DensityDecayRangeTest\\\" -> <|\\\"Value\\\" -> \
assoc[\\\"InformationDensityRatio\\\"], \\\"Pass\\\" -> 0 < \
assoc[\\\"InformationDensityRatio\\\"] <= 1|>,\\n    \
\\\"WindingIntegralityTest\\\" -> <|\\\"Value\\\" -> \
assoc[\\\"WindingNumber\\\"], \\\"Pass\\\" -> \
IntegerQ[assoc[\\\"WindingNumber\\\"]]|>,\\n    \\\"FiniteWaveSpeedTest\\\" \
-> <|\\\"Value\\\" -> assoc[\\\"WaveSpeedRatio\\\"], \\\"Pass\\\" -> \
NumericQ[assoc[\\\"WaveSpeedRatio\\\"]] && TrueQ[0 < assoc[\\\"WaveSpeedRatio\
\\\"] < waveUpper]|>,\\n    \\\"LengthResolutionDualityTest\\\" -> <|\\n      \
\\\"Value\\\" -> UnitSimplify[assoc[\\\"LengthScale\\\"] \
assoc[\\\"SpatialResolution\\\"]],\\n      \\\"Reference\\\" -> \
UnitSimplify[planckLength^2],\\n      \\\"Pass\\\" -> \
TrueQ[UnitSimplify[assoc[\\\"LengthScale\\\"] \
assoc[\\\"SpatialResolution\\\"] == planckLength^2]]\\n    |>,\\n    \
\\\"PreviousComplexityMonotonicityTest\\\" -> <|\\n      \\\"Value\\\" -> \
If[AssociationQ[prev], {prev[\\\"Complexity\\\"], assoc[\\\"Complexity\\\"]}, \
Missing[\\\"NotAvailable\\\"]],\\n      \\\"Pass\\\" -> \
If[AssociationQ[prev], assoc[\\\"Complexity\\\"] >= prev[\\\"Complexity\\\"], \
True]\\n    |>,\\n    \\\"NextDensityMonotonicityTest\\\" -> <|\\n      \
\\\"Value\\\" -> If[AssociationQ[next], \
{assoc[\\\"InformationDensityRatio\\\"], \
next[\\\"InformationDensityRatio\\\"]}, Missing[\\\"NotAvailable\\\"]],\\n    \
  \\\"Pass\\\" -> If[AssociationQ[next], \
assoc[\\\"InformationDensityRatio\\\"] >= \
next[\\\"InformationDensityRatio\\\"], True]\\n    |>\\n  \
|>\\n];\\n\\nsummarizePassRate[testAssoc_Association] := Module[{passes},\\n  \
passes = Lookup[Values[testAssoc], \\\"Pass\\\"];\\n  <|\\n    \
\\\"PassCount\\\" -> Count[passes, True],\\n    \\\"FailCount\\\" -> \
Count[passes, False],\\n    \\\"PassFraction\\\" -> N[Count[passes, \
True]/Length[passes], 20]\\n  |>\\n];\\n```\\n\\n## 5. Waveform family, PDE \
residual proxy, and stability search\\n\\nThis section adds automatic search \
for \\\"most stable waveforms\\\" in a testable way. Since the full \
integro-differential equation is symbolic and not fully specified \
numerically, the practical rigorous approach is:\\n\\n- define a \
parameterized waveform family\\n- define a residual-like stability functional\
\\n- optimize it over waveform parameters for each \
scale\\n\\n```wl\\nClearAll[\\n  waveformFunction, \
waveformParameterAssociation,\\n  waveformResidualFunctional, \
waveformObjective,\\n  findMostStableWaveform, \
batchFindMostStableWaveforms\\n];\\n\\nwaveformFunction[n_Integer, \
params_Association][x_, t_] := Module[\\n  {\\n    amplitude = \
params[\\\"Amplitude\\\"],\\n    decay = params[\\\"Decay\\\"],\\n    omega = \
params[\\\"Omega\\\"],\\n    k = params[\\\"WaveNumber\\\"],\\n    phase = \
params[\\\"Phase\\\"]\\n  },\\n  amplitude Exp[-decay t] Cos[k x - omega t + \
phase]\\n];\\n\\nwaveformParameterAssociation[{amplitude_, decay_, omega_, \
waveNumber_, phase_}] := <|\\n  \\\"Amplitude\\\" -> amplitude,\\n  \\\"Decay\
\\\" -> decay,\\n  \\\"Omega\\\" -> omega,\\n  \\\"WaveNumber\\\" -> \
waveNumber,\\n  \\\"Phase\\\" -> \
phase\\n|>;\\n\\nOptions[waveformResidualFunctional] = \
Join[Options[scaleAssociation], {\\n  \\\"XDomain\\\" -> {-1, 1},\\n  \
\\\"TDomain\\\" -> {0, 1},\\n  \\\"WorkingPrecision\\\" -> \
80\\n}];\\n\\nwaveformResidualFunctional[n_Integer, params_Association, opts \
: OptionsPattern[]] := Module[\\n  {\\n    epsilon = \
OptionValue[\\\"Epsilon\\\"],\\n    rho0 = OptionValue[\\\"Rho0\\\"],\\n    \
mass = OptionValue[\\\"Mass\\\"],\\n    hbar = OptionValue[\\\"HBar\\\"],\\n  \
  c = OptionValue[\\\"LightSpeed\\\"],\\n    xDomain = \
OptionValue[\\\"XDomain\\\"],\\n    tDomain = \
OptionValue[\\\"TDomain\\\"],\\n    wp = \
OptionValue[\\\"WorkingPrecision\\\"],\\n    psi, waveRatio, gCoupling, \
iCoupling, pdeExpr\\n  },\\n  psi[x_, t_] := waveformFunction[n, params][x, \
t];\\n  waveRatio = SetPrecision[waveSpeedRatio[n, epsilon, rho0], wp];\\n  \
gCoupling = SetPrecision[gradientCoupling[n, mass, hbar, c], wp];\\n  \
iCoupling = SetPrecision[infoCoupling[n, hbar, c], wp];\\n  pdeExpr = \
(1/waveRatio^2) D[psi[x, t], {t, 2}] - D[psi[x, t], {x, 2}] + \
params[\\\"Decay\\\"] D[psi[x, t], t] + gCoupling psi[x, t] + iCoupling;\\n  \
NIntegrate[\\n    Evaluate[Abs[pdeExpr]^2],\\n    {x, xDomain[[1]], \
xDomain[[2]]},\\n    {t, tDomain[[1]], tDomain[[2]]},\\n    WorkingPrecision \
-> wp,\\n    AccuracyGoal -> Floor[wp/3],\\n    PrecisionGoal -> Floor[wp/3],\
\\n    Method -> {\\\"GlobalAdaptive\\\", \\\"SymbolicProcessing\\\" -> 0}\\n \
 ]\\n];\\n\\nOptions[waveformObjective] = \
Options[waveformResidualFunctional];\\n\\nwaveformObjective[n_Integer, vars : \
{amplitude_, decay_, omega_, waveNumber_, phase_}, opts : OptionsPattern[]] \
:=\\n  waveformResidualFunctional[n, waveformParameterAssociation[vars], \
opts];\\n\\nOptions[findMostStableWaveform] = \
Join[Options[waveformResidualFunctional], {\\n  \\\"SearchRanges\\\" -> <|\\n \
   \\\"Amplitude\\\" -> {0.1, 2},\\n    \\\"Decay\\\" -> {0, 2},\\n    \
\\\"Omega\\\" -> {0.1, 10},\\n    \\\"WaveNumber\\\" -> {0.1, 10},\\n    \
\\\"Phase\\\" -> {0, 2 Pi}\\n  \
|>\\n}];\\n\\nfindMostStableWaveform[n_Integer, opts : OptionsPattern[]] := \
Module[\\n  {\\n    ranges = OptionValue[\\\"SearchRanges\\\"],\\n    wp = \
OptionValue[\\\"WorkingPrecision\\\"],\\n    result\\n  },\\n  result = \
NMinimize[\\n    {\\n      waveformObjective[n, {amplitude, decay, omega, \
waveNumber, phase}, FilterRules[{opts}, \
Options[waveformResidualFunctional]]],\\n      ranges[\\\"Amplitude\\\"][[1]] \
<= amplitude <= ranges[\\\"Amplitude\\\"][[2]] &&\\n      \
ranges[\\\"Decay\\\"][[1]] <= decay <= ranges[\\\"Decay\\\"][[2]] &&\\n      \
ranges[\\\"Omega\\\"][[1]] <= omega <= ranges[\\\"Omega\\\"][[2]] &&\\n      \
ranges[\\\"WaveNumber\\\"][[1]] <= waveNumber <= \
ranges[\\\"WaveNumber\\\"][[2]] &&\\n      ranges[\\\"Phase\\\"][[1]] <= \
phase <= ranges[\\\"Phase\\\"][[2]]\\n    },\\n    {amplitude, decay, omega, \
waveNumber, phase},\\n    WorkingPrecision -> wp,\\n    AccuracyGoal -> \
Floor[wp/3],\\n    PrecisionGoal -> Floor[wp/3],\\n    Method -> \
{\\\"NelderMead\\\", \\\"RandomSeed\\\" -> 1234}\\n  ];\\n  <|\\n    \
\\\"Scale\\\" -> n,\\n    \\\"Realm\\\" -> Lookup[realmName, n, \\\"Unknown\\\
\"],\\n    \\\"MinimumResidual\\\" -> result[[1]],\\n    \\\"BestParameters\\\
\" -> AssociationThread[\\n      {\\\"Amplitude\\\", \\\"Decay\\\", \\\"Omega\
\\\", \\\"WaveNumber\\\", \\\"Phase\\\"},\\n      {amplitude, decay, omega, \
waveNumber, phase} /. result[[2]]\\n    ],\\n    \
\\\"RawOptimizationResult\\\" -> result\\n  \
|>\\n];\\n\\nbatchFindMostStableWaveforms[opts : \
OptionsPattern[findMostStableWaveform]] :=\\n  \
AssociationThread[stableScales, findMostStableWaveform[#, opts] & /@ \
stableScales];\\n```\\n\\n## 6. Visual \
helpers\\n\\n```wl\\nClearAll[testResultGrid, scaleSummaryDataset, \
stabilityPlot, waveformPlot, \
waveformResidualBarChart];\\n\\ntestResultGrid[testAssoc_Association] := \
Module[{rows},\\n  rows = KeyValueMap[\\n    With[{pass = TrueQ[#2[\\\"Pass\\\
\"]]},\\n      {If[pass, Lighter[Green, .9], Lighter[Red, .9]], #1, \
#2[\\\"Value\\\"], Lookup[#2, \\\"Threshold\\\", \\\"\\\"], pass}\\n    ] \
&,\\n    testAssoc\\n  ];\\n  Grid[\\n    Prepend[(Rest /@ rows), {\\\"Test\\\
\", \\\"Value\\\", \\\"Threshold\\\", \\\"Pass\\\"}],\\n    Frame -> All,\\n  \
  Background -> Prepend[(List /@ rows[[All, 1]]), None]\\n  \
]\\n];\\n\\nOptions[scaleSummaryDataset] = \
Options[scaleAssociation];\\n\\nscaleSummaryDataset[opts : OptionsPattern[]] \
:= Dataset[scaleAssociation[#, opts] & /@ \
stableScales];\\n\\nstabilityPlot[opts : OptionsPattern[{\\\"Threshold\\\" -> \
0.99}]] := Module[\\n  {scores, threshold = \
OptionValue[\\\"Threshold\\\"]},\\n  scores = stabilityScore /@ stableScales;\
\\n  ListLinePlot[\\n    {\\n      Transpose[{stableScales, scores}],\\n      \
Transpose[{stableScales, ConstantArray[threshold, Length[stableScales]]}]\\n  \
  },\\n    PlotLegends -> {\\\"StabilityScore\\\", \\\"Threshold\\\"},\\n    \
PlotMarkers -> Automatic,\\n    GridLines -> {stableScales, {threshold}},\\n  \
  ImageSize -> Large,\\n    PlotRange -> All\\n  \
]\\n];\\n\\nwaveformPlot[n_Integer, params_Association, tValue_: 0] := \
Plot[\\n  Evaluate[waveformFunction[n, params][x, tValue]],\\n  {x, -2 Pi, 2 \
Pi},\\n  PlotRange -> All,\\n  PlotLabel -> Row[{\\\"Waveform at scale \\\", \
n, \\\" and time \\\", tValue}],\\n  AxesLabel -> {\\\"x\\\", \
\\\"Psi\\\"},\\n  ImageSize -> \
Large\\n];\\n\\nwaveformResidualBarChart[resultAssoc_Association] := \
Module[{vals, keys},\\n  keys = Keys[resultAssoc];\\n  vals = \
Lookup[resultAssoc /@ keys, \\\"MinimumResidual\\\"];\\n  BarChart[\\n    \
vals,\\n    ChartLabels -> Placed[keys, Below],\\n    ScalingFunctions -> \
\\\"Log\\\",\\n    PlotLabel -> \\\"Minimum Residual by Stable Scale\\\",\\n  \
  ImageSize -> Large\\n  ]\\n];\\n```\\n\\n## 7. Per-scale report \
generator\\n\\n```wl\\nClearAll[scaleReport];\\n\\nOptions[scaleReport] = \
Join[Options[runScaleTests], \
Options[findMostStableWaveform]];\\n\\nscaleReport[n_Integer, opts : \
OptionsPattern[]] := Module[\\n  {assoc, tests, passSummary, bestWave},\\n  \
assoc = scaleAssociation[n, FilterRules[{opts}, \
Options[scaleAssociation]]];\\n  tests = runScaleTests[n, FilterRules[{opts}, \
Options[runScaleTests]]];\\n  passSummary = summarizePassRate[tests];\\n  \
bestWave = findMostStableWaveform[n, FilterRules[{opts}, \
Options[findMostStableWaveform]]];\\n  <|\\n    \\\"ScaleData\\\" -> \
assoc,\\n    \\\"Tests\\\" -> tests,\\n    \\\"TestSummary\\\" -> \
passSummary,\\n    \\\"BestWaveform\\\" -> bestWave\\n  |>\\n];\\n```\\n\\n## \
8. Export helpers that work in unsaved \
notebooks\\n\\n```wl\\nClearAll[safeExportDirectory, exportRHUFTJSON, \
exportRHUFTWXF];\\n\\nsafeExportDirectory[] := Module[{dir = \
Quiet@NotebookDirectory[]},\\n  Which[\\n    StringQ[dir], dir,\\n    \
StringQ[$HomeDirectory], $HomeDirectory,\\n    True, Directory[]\\n  \
]\\n];\\n\\nexportRHUFTJSON[data_, fileName_: \
\\\"rhuft-scale-summary.json\\\"] := Module[{path},\\n  path = \
FileNameJoin[{safeExportDirectory[], fileName}];\\n  Export[path, data, \
\\\"JSON\\\"]\\n];\\n\\nexportRHUFTWXF[data_, fileName_: \
\\\"rhuft-scale-summary.wxf\\\"] := Module[{path},\\n  path = \
FileNameJoin[{safeExportDirectory[], fileName}];\\n  Export[path, data, \
\\\"WXF\\\"]\\n];\\n```\\n\\n## 9. Button-driven interactive \
evaluator\\n\\n```wl\\nDynamicModule[\\n  {\\n    n = 13,\\n    epsilon = 0.,\
\\n    rho0 = 1.,\\n    mass = 1.,\\n    hbar = 1.,\\n    cNorm = 1.,\\n    \
stabilityThreshold = 0.99,\\n    waveSpeedUpperBound = 10^12,\\n    \
workingPrecision = 50,\\n    currentAssoc = <||>,\\n    currentTests = \
<||>,\\n    currentReport = <||>,\\n    bestWave = <||>,\\n    allWaveResults \
= <||>\\n  },\\n  Column[{\\n    Style[\\\"RHUFT Full Scale Evaluator\\\", \
20, Bold],\\n    Grid[{\\n      {\\\"Scale\\\", PopupMenu[Dynamic[n], \
stableScales]},\\n      {\\\"Epsilon\\\", Slider[Dynamic[epsilon], {0, \
0.1}]},\\n      {\\\"Rho0\\\", InputField[Dynamic[rho0], Number]},\\n      \
{\\\"Mass\\\", InputField[Dynamic[mass], Number]},\\n      {\\\"HBar\\\", \
InputField[Dynamic[hbar], Number]},\\n      {\\\"LightSpeedNorm\\\", \
InputField[Dynamic[cNorm], Number]},\\n      {\\\"StabilityThreshold\\\", \
Slider[Dynamic[stabilityThreshold], {0.9, 0.999999}]},\\n      \
{\\\"WaveSpeedUpperBound\\\", InputField[Dynamic[waveSpeedUpperBound], \
Number]},\\n      {\\\"WorkingPrecision\\\", \
SetterBar[Dynamic[workingPrecision], {30, 50, 80, 100}]}\\n    }, Alignment \
-> Left],\\n    Row[{\\n      Button[\\\"Compute Scale Data\\\",\\n        \
currentAssoc = scaleAssociation[\\n          n,\\n          \\\"Epsilon\\\" \
-> epsilon,\\n          \\\"Rho0\\\" -> rho0,\\n          \\\"Mass\\\" -> \
mass,\\n          \\\"HBar\\\" -> hbar,\\n          \\\"LightSpeed\\\" -> \
cNorm,\\n          \\\"StabilityThreshold\\\" -> stabilityThreshold\\n        \
],\\n        Method -> \\\"Queued\\\"\\n      ],\\n      Spacer[10],\\n      \
Button[\\\"Run Tests\\\",\\n        currentTests = runScaleTests[\\n          \
n,\\n          \\\"Epsilon\\\" -> epsilon,\\n          \\\"Rho0\\\" -> \
rho0,\\n          \\\"Mass\\\" -> mass,\\n          \\\"HBar\\\" -> hbar,\\n  \
        \\\"LightSpeed\\\" -> cNorm,\\n          \\\"StabilityThreshold\\\" \
-> stabilityThreshold,\\n          \\\"WaveSpeedUpperBound\\\" -> \
waveSpeedUpperBound,\\n          \\\"WorkingPrecision\\\" -> workingPrecision\
\\n        ],\\n        Method -> \\\"Queued\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \
Spacer[10],\\n      Button[\\\"Find Most Stable Waveform\\\",\\n        \
bestWave = findMostStableWaveform[\\n          n,\\n          \\\"Epsilon\\\" \
-> epsilon,\\n          \\\"Rho0\\\" -> rho0,\\n          \\\"Mass\\\" -> \
mass,\\n          \\\"HBar\\\" -> hbar,\\n          \\\"LightSpeed\\\" -> \
cNorm,\\n          \\\"WorkingPrecision\\\" -> workingPrecision\\n        \
],\\n        Method -> \\\"Queued\\\"\\n      ],\\n      Spacer[10],\\n      \
Button[\\\"Build Full Scale Report\\\",\\n        currentReport = \
scaleReport[\\n          n,\\n          \\\"Epsilon\\\" -> epsilon,\\n        \
  \\\"Rho0\\\" -> rho0,\\n          \\\"Mass\\\" -> mass,\\n          \
\\\"HBar\\\" -> hbar,\\n          \\\"LightSpeed\\\" -> cNorm,\\n          \\\
\"StabilityThreshold\\\" -> stabilityThreshold,\\n          \
\\\"WaveSpeedUpperBound\\\" -> waveSpeedUpperBound,\\n          \
\\\"WorkingPrecision\\\" -> workingPrecision\\n        ],\\n        Method -> \
\\\"Queued\\\"\\n      ],\\n      Spacer[10],\\n      Button[\\\"Search All \
Stable Scales\\\",\\n        allWaveResults = \
batchFindMostStableWaveforms[\\n          \\\"Epsilon\\\" -> epsilon,\\n      \
    \\\"Rho0\\\" -> rho0,\\n          \\\"Mass\\\" -> mass,\\n          \
\\\"HBar\\\" -> hbar,\\n          \\\"LightSpeed\\\" -> cNorm,\\n          \\\
\"WorkingPrecision\\\" -> workingPrecision\\n        ],\\n        Method -> \
\\\"Queued\\\"\\n      ]\\n    }],\\n    Delimiter,\\n    Style[\\\"Current \
Scale Data\\\", 16, Bold],\\n    Dynamic[If[currentAssoc === <||>, \\\"No \
scale data computed yet.\\\", Dataset[currentAssoc]]],\\n    \
Style[\\\"Current Tests\\\", 16, Bold],\\n    Dynamic[If[currentTests === \
<||>, \\\"No tests run yet.\\\", testResultGrid[currentTests]]],\\n    Style[\
\\\"Best Waveform\\\", 16, Bold],\\n    Dynamic[\\n      If[bestWave === \
<||>,\\n        \\\"No waveform search run yet.\\\",\\n        Column[{\\n    \
      Dataset[bestWave],\\n          waveformPlot[n, \
bestWave[\\\"BestParameters\\\"]]\\n        }]\\n      ]\\n    ],\\n    \
Style[\\\"Full Scale Report\\\", 16, Bold],\\n    Dynamic[If[currentReport \
=== <||>, \\\"No full report built yet.\\\", Dataset[currentReport]]],\\n    \
Style[\\\"Global Stability Plot\\\", 16, Bold],\\n    \
Dynamic[stabilityPlot[\\\"Threshold\\\" -> stabilityThreshold]],\\n    Style[\
\\\"All-Scale Waveform Search Summary\\\", 16, Bold],\\n    Dynamic[\\n      \
If[allWaveResults === <||>,\\n        \\\"No batch search run yet.\\\",\\n    \
    Column[{Dataset[allWaveResults], \
waveformResidualBarChart[allWaveResults]}]\\n      ]\\n    ]\\n  }, Spacings \
-> 2]\\n]\\n```\\n\\n## 10. Build all individual scale reports at \
once\\n\\n```wl\\nClearAll[allScaleReports];\\n\\nOptions[allScaleReports] = \
Options[scaleReport];\\n\\nallScaleReports[opts : OptionsPattern[]] := \
AssociationThread[\\n  stableScales,\\n  scaleReport[#, opts] & /@ \
stableScales\\n];\\n```\\n\\n## 11. Example usage\\n\\nGenerate one complete \
report for a single scale:\\n\\n```wl\\nreport13 = scaleReport[\\n  13,\\n  \
\\\"Epsilon\\\" -> 0.001,\\n  \\\"Rho0\\\" -> 1,\\n  \\\"Mass\\\" -> 1,\\n  \
\\\"HBar\\\" -> 1,\\n  \\\"LightSpeed\\\" -> 1,\\n  \
\\\"StabilityThreshold\\\" -> 0.99,\\n  \\\"WaveSpeedUpperBound\\\" -> 10^12,\
\\n  \\\"WorkingPrecision\\\" -> 50\\n];\\n```\\n\\nGenerate all \
reports:\\n\\n```wl\\nreports = allScaleReports[\\n  \\\"Epsilon\\\" -> \
0.001,\\n  \\\"Rho0\\\" -> 1,\\n  \\\"Mass\\\" -> 1,\\n  \\\"HBar\\\" -> \
1,\\n  \\\"LightSpeed\\\" -> 1,\\n  \\\"StabilityThreshold\\\" -> 0.99,\\n  \
\\\"WaveSpeedUpperBound\\\" -> 10^12,\\n  \\\"WorkingPrecision\\\" -> 50\\n];\
\\n```\\n\\nExport \
safely:\\n\\n```wl\\nexportRHUFTJSON[Normal@scaleSummaryDataset[], \
\\\"rhuft-scale-summary.json\\\"]\\n```\\n\\nExport all \
reports:\\n\\n```wl\\nexportRHUFTWXF[reports, \\\"rhuft-all-scale-reports.wxf\
\\\"]\\n```\\n\\n## 12. Functional entry points\\n\\nThese are the main \
callable functions in the framework:\\n\\n- ``scaleAssociation[n, ...]``\\n- \
``runScaleTests[n, ...]``\\n- ``scaleReport[n, ...]``\\n- \
``allScaleReports[...]``\\n- ``findMostStableWaveform[n, ...]``\\n- \
``batchFindMostStableWaveforms[...]``\\n- ``scaleSummaryDataset[...]``\\n- \
``exportRHUFTJSON[data, fileName]``\\n- ``exportRHUFTWXF[data, fileName]``\\n\
\\n## 13. Final note on rigor\\n\\nThis framework is more rigorous than the \
original notebook because it distinguishes:\\n\\n- symbolic RHUFT parameter \
definitions\\n- algebraic consistency tests\\n- monotonicity and duality \
checks\\n- numerical residual minimization for waveform stability\\n- \
reproducible, button-driven execution\\n- safe exporting independent of \
notebook save state\\n\\nIf you want, I can next generate either:\\n\\n1. a \
**TypeScript project skeleton** matching these functions, or\\n2. an even \
more advanced **variational/PDE residual framework** using \
[NDSolve](paclet:ref/NDSolve), \
[ParametricNDSolveValue](paclet:ref/ParametricNDSolveValue), and eigenmode \
analysis.\"\>",
                    StripOnInput->False,
